00:01:04.984 --> 00:01:07.653
21%, 22%, 23%, 24%, 25%...

00:01:07.861 --> 00:01:09.738
Admiration, troubles, pump up

00:01:09.947 --> 00:01:12.575
26%, 27%, 28%, 29%, 30%...

00:01:12.783 --> 00:01:14.827
Searching for yourself, telepathy

00:01:15.035 --> 00:01:17.538
31%, 32%, 33%, 34%, 35%...

00:01:17.746 --> 00:01:19.790
Asking for the impossible, psycho punch

00:01:19.999 --> 00:01:22.751
36%, 37%, 38%, 39%, 40%...

00:01:22.960 --> 00:01:25.337
Youthful Salt Splash

00:01:25.546 --> 00:01:27.798
Mob? Mob? What do you want?

00:01:28.007 --> 00:01:30.384
Mob? Mob? Why do you want?

00:01:30.593 --> 00:01:32.928
Mob? Mob? Who do you want?

00:01:33.137 --> 00:01:34.847
Move! Move! Just like Mob!

00:01:35.055 --> 00:01:37.182
If everyone is not special

00:01:37.391 --> 00:01:39.852
Maybe you can be what you want to be

00:01:40.060 --> 00:01:45.107
Even if you hold onto happiness and sadness

00:01:45.316 --> 00:01:50.112
Your life is your own, OK?
It's OK you are not special

00:01:50.321 --> 00:01:55.242
We'll all be able to find our answers

00:01:55.451 --> 00:02:00.289
81%, 82%, 83%, 84%, 85%,
86%, 87%, 88%, 89%, 90%...

00:02:00.497 --> 00:02:06.545
91%, 92%, 93%, 94%, 95%,
96%, 97%, 98%, 99%...

00:02:06.545 --> 00:02:09.381
"Mob Psycho 100" 91%, 92%, 93%,
94%, 95%, 96%, 97%, 98%, 99%...

00:02:09.381 --> 00:02:10.799
91%, 92%, 93%, 94%, 95%,
96%, 97%, 98%, 99%...

00:02:12.009 --> 00:02:16.513
"OCHIMUSHA"
" ~Psychic Powers and Me~"

00:02:17.473 --> 00:02:19.391
Be careful just in case, Shigeo.

00:02:19.600 --> 00:02:22.853
Even you could get tripped up
if you're not care--

00:02:24.980 --> 00:02:26.940
Sorry, I wasn't listening.

00:02:27.149 --> 00:02:28.275
What?!

00:02:28.484 --> 00:02:32.154
Why are you attacking me?
I haven't done anything.

00:02:32.363 --> 00:02:33.989
Let's be...

00:02:35.532 --> 00:02:38.118
He's on guard.

00:02:38.327 --> 00:02:40.913
Not that I don't understand how he feels.

00:02:41.121 --> 00:02:45.417
I bet he's lived his life so far
as the big fish in a very small pond.

00:02:45.626 --> 00:02:49.630
And for the first time ever, he's meeting
someone that could be his natural enemy.

00:02:49.838 --> 00:02:53.008
If he doesn't establish
his superiority right now,

00:02:53.217 --> 00:02:55.219
he won't be satisfied, I'm sure.

00:02:55.427 --> 00:02:56.970
But, that aside...

00:02:57.179 --> 00:03:00.307
What's with those weird movements?
They're kinda like wire action.

00:03:00.516 --> 00:03:01.850
Telekinesis.

00:03:02.059 --> 00:03:03.936
It lets you move objects around, and stuff.

00:03:04.144 --> 00:03:05.729
You're not gonna do it?

00:03:05.938 --> 00:03:08.190
I get nauseous, so no.

00:03:08.399 --> 00:03:11.193
I use telekinesis to teleport
close to my opponent

00:03:11.402 --> 00:03:13.195
and blow him away with my Psycho Fist.

00:03:13.404 --> 00:03:16.573
This dancing strategy that I've perfected
to use against average people

00:03:16.782 --> 00:03:20.160
apparently looks like nothing more
than weird movements against him.

00:03:20.369 --> 00:03:21.787
Damn it!

00:03:21.995 --> 00:03:24.873
Shigeo, you need to teach him a lesson here.

00:03:25.082 --> 00:03:27.376
Show him who's boss.

00:03:27.584 --> 00:03:30.587
Come on. Look at how he's standing.
He's gonna attack again.

00:03:30.796 --> 00:03:33.215
You need to hit him
with something big, too.

00:03:33.424 --> 00:03:37.302
No. You're not supposed to use
psychic powers against people.

00:03:37.511 --> 00:03:40.180
You idiot! Look at who you're talking about!

00:03:40.389 --> 00:03:45.060
He's put his psychic powers to good use
and is living a fulfilling life!

00:03:45.269 --> 00:03:46.937
And then look at you.

00:03:47.146 --> 00:03:50.149
You live a dull lifestyle,
with one boring day after another.

00:03:50.357 --> 00:03:54.403
Do you think there's anything appealing
about you without your psychic powers?

00:03:55.404 --> 00:03:57.489
Listen up!

00:03:57.698 --> 00:04:02.327
We were born with special powers
that other people don't have,

00:04:02.536 --> 00:04:06.415
but we mustn't let it get to our heads
and think we're special.

00:04:06.623 --> 00:04:08.208
People who are fast,

00:04:08.208 --> 00:04:08.250
"39th Choral Competition"
People who are fast,

00:04:08.250 --> 00:04:08.459
"39th Choral Competition"

00:04:08.459 --> 00:04:09.960
"39th Choral Competition"
people who sing well,

00:04:10.169 --> 00:04:11.754
people who are book smart,

00:04:11.962 --> 00:04:13.797
people who are good at talking,

00:04:14.006 --> 00:04:16.258
and people who can use psychic powers...

00:04:16.467 --> 00:04:19.261
You can't put one over the other.

00:04:19.470 --> 00:04:22.973
Being confident about your powers is fine,
but you mustn't get conceited.

00:04:23.182 --> 00:04:27.019
Depending on how we use our powers,
they can also be deadly weapons.

00:04:27.227 --> 00:04:28.896
They're just like knives.

00:04:29.104 --> 00:04:32.399
What are you not
supposed to do with knives?

00:04:32.608 --> 00:04:34.151
Point them at people?

00:04:34.359 --> 00:04:38.363
So you do get it.
Make sure you never forget that.

00:04:38.572 --> 00:04:41.992
That's the moral code people like us
with special powers need to live by.

00:04:42.201 --> 00:04:45.162
That all gets ruined
once you know Reigen said it.

00:04:45.370 --> 00:04:47.748
Anyway, I won't use them in a fight.

00:04:47.956 --> 00:04:52.169
Also, I don't want to live a life
having to rely on psychic powers.

00:04:52.377 --> 00:04:55.589
I'm going to find
some other potential within me.

00:04:55.798 --> 00:04:58.133
Not to mention, I started working out.

00:04:58.342 --> 00:05:00.552
I'm going to change.

00:05:00.761 --> 00:05:03.597
You say that, but...

00:05:03.806 --> 00:05:05.766
--Shigeo!
--How about that?!

00:05:05.974 --> 00:05:09.144
That was a telekinetic tackle
with all my weight behind it.

00:05:09.353 --> 00:05:12.773
A life without using psychic powers?

00:05:12.981 --> 00:05:14.149
How stupid!

00:05:14.358 --> 00:05:18.570
There's no reason to live your life
stooping to the level of average people!

00:05:19.655 --> 00:05:22.616
Other potentials are absolutely useless!

00:05:22.825 --> 00:05:24.326
Working out? Studying?

00:05:24.535 --> 00:05:28.247
Leave all that crap to the average people!

00:05:30.165 --> 00:05:35.087
Brain, brawn, and even the law
are all powerless before my gift!

00:05:35.295 --> 00:05:40.133
I'm special, and the world
revolves around me!

00:05:40.342 --> 00:05:43.262
Jeez, I guess there's no choice.

00:05:43.470 --> 00:05:47.558
Hey, little boy. How about
we just call this a draw?

00:05:47.766 --> 00:05:48.809
Not happening.

00:05:49.017 --> 00:05:53.438
Ending up in a draw with a guy like that
would be the biggest disgrace in my life.

00:05:53.647 --> 00:05:58.110
I can't have you breaking Shigeo, either.

00:05:58.318 --> 00:06:01.029
He has no intention of fighting back,
so he's obviously going to lose.

00:06:01.238 --> 00:06:04.950
That... wouldn't be good.

00:06:05.158 --> 00:06:06.618
Dimple?

00:06:06.827 --> 00:06:09.037
Most of my spiritual power's been erased,

00:06:09.246 --> 00:06:11.790
so I'm pretty much just
some scraps left over, but...

00:06:11.999 --> 00:06:18.297
Even then, I shouldn't have any problems
disciplining a cocky little brat.

00:06:18.505 --> 00:06:23.969
Shigeo's a man who can become a god.
He's not a second-rate loser like--

00:06:24.177 --> 00:06:25.804
Huh?

00:06:28.056 --> 00:06:29.808
Dimple!

00:06:30.017 --> 00:06:33.020
I erased that thing with my Psycho Wave.

00:06:33.228 --> 00:06:37.107
From the core, so there wouldn't
be a single shred left.

00:06:37.316 --> 00:06:41.194
Dimple's been exorcised...

00:06:41.820 --> 00:06:42.321
"Progress Toward Mob's Explosion: 47%"

00:06:42.321 --> 00:06:43.572
"Progress Toward Mob's Explosion: 50%"

00:06:43.906 --> 00:06:45.616
Forget about your club.

00:06:45.824 --> 00:06:47.784
Work on your psychic powers instead!

00:06:47.993 --> 00:06:51.204
Tsubomi-chan, eh? She's got a nice ass.

00:06:51.413 --> 00:06:52.998
Who the hell are you calling a ladybug?!

00:06:53.206 --> 00:06:55.751
I'm gonna send your master to the hospital.

00:06:55.959 --> 00:06:59.046
I'll make you popular.

00:06:59.254 --> 00:07:02.007
Hey! Want me to show you
how to use X-ray vision?

00:07:02.215 --> 00:07:04.593
I don't know either, you perv!

00:07:04.801 --> 00:07:09.598
Just for a sec, would you
let me take over your body?

00:07:10.390 --> 00:07:12.100
Dimple...

00:07:12.309 --> 00:07:16.980
What? Are you so shocked
that your pet was erased?

00:07:17.189 --> 00:07:18.482
Not really.

00:07:18.482 --> 00:07:18.690
"Progress Toward Mob's Explosion: 50%"
Not really.

00:07:18.690 --> 00:07:19.483
"Progress Toward Mob's Explosion: 50%"

00:07:21.443 --> 00:07:23.612
Yeah, I guess you wouldn't be...

00:07:23.820 --> 00:07:27.616
After all, it was sort of a pointless
existence to begin with.

00:07:28.867 --> 00:07:31.328
Though that goes for you, too.

00:07:31.536 --> 00:07:35.040
Compared to me, you're third-rate.
Nothing but small fry.

00:07:35.248 --> 00:07:38.710
You can become big! I guarantee it!

00:07:38.919 --> 00:07:42.339
Some idiots get the wrong idea
if things aren't spelled out for them.

00:07:42.547 --> 00:07:46.301
They think they can be someone
if they actually try.

00:07:46.510 --> 00:07:50.597
Be more confident, Shigeo!
After all, you're the main character!

00:07:53.642 --> 00:07:57.104
What? What's with that look?

00:07:57.312 --> 00:08:00.357
Hey, why do you have to belittle others

00:08:00.565 --> 00:08:03.527
by calling them average or small fry?

00:08:03.735 --> 00:08:04.736
Wha...?

00:08:04.945 --> 00:08:09.700
Well, I just realized that he might
actually have been an okay guy, that's all...

00:08:09.908 --> 00:08:11.201
Compared to you.

00:08:11.410 --> 00:08:13.036
What?

00:08:14.871 --> 00:08:16.748
Don't...

00:08:16.957 --> 00:08:21.128
...think that you can keep that
smug look on your face forever!

00:08:23.338 --> 00:08:25.966
I'll make you submit to me
with my psychic powers!

00:08:26.174 --> 00:08:29.553
I'm gonna come at you
with full power and no brakes!

00:08:29.761 --> 00:08:30.721
That's dangerous.

00:08:30.929 --> 00:08:32.597
If it wasn't me, you could hurt someone.

00:08:32.806 --> 00:08:33.515
Stop that.

00:08:33.724 --> 00:08:36.476
Are you trying to say
that you won't get hurt?

00:08:36.685 --> 00:08:41.940
Quit underestimating my powers!

00:08:59.041 --> 00:09:02.002
What's wrong? You just going
to keep defending yourself?

00:09:02.210 --> 00:09:04.838
I told you to stop that.

00:09:05.922 --> 00:09:08.383
Show me your powers!

00:09:11.303 --> 00:09:12.888
If you're not going
to show me your powers,

00:09:13.096 --> 00:09:15.807
I guess we'll have to try something else.

00:09:16.016 --> 00:09:20.687
I'll just see how much you can take
by administering an endurance test.

00:09:33.283 --> 00:09:34.910
Ow.

00:09:35.869 --> 00:09:38.163
The home ec room.

00:09:40.582 --> 00:09:43.085
Knives are dangerous.
You shouldn't point--

00:09:43.293 --> 00:09:47.130
Don't order me around.
You'll reduce your lifespan that way.

00:09:47.339 --> 00:09:49.257
Of course, I have no intention
of killing him,

00:09:49.466 --> 00:09:52.886
but I'm sure he'll feel
like fighting back now.

00:09:53.095 --> 00:09:56.473
Will you stop? This is going
to cause an accident.

00:09:56.681 --> 00:09:58.558
Huh?

00:10:05.357 --> 00:10:09.444
You did this on purpose, didn't you?

00:10:09.653 --> 00:10:12.197
A huge accident has occurred.

00:10:14.491 --> 00:10:16.159
I'm going to kill you!

00:10:18.036 --> 00:10:20.038
"Top of Teru's Head 0%"

00:10:22.124 --> 00:10:23.041
"Mob Psycho 100"

00:10:28.171 --> 00:10:30.215
You'll pay for this.

00:10:30.423 --> 00:10:33.593
I won't forgive you, even if you apologize!

00:10:42.060 --> 00:10:43.562
You...

00:10:43.770 --> 00:10:47.274
You totally thought I look even more
like an ochimusha now, didn't you?

00:10:47.482 --> 00:10:49.025
Huh? I didn't say that.

00:10:49.234 --> 00:10:50.735
So you did think it.

00:10:50.944 --> 00:10:55.907
No, that's fine. I'll admit it.
This shameful sight! This truth!

00:10:56.116 --> 00:10:58.743
And I'll acknowledge you, too.

00:10:58.952 --> 00:11:01.288
What's your name?

00:11:01.496 --> 00:11:04.541
Kageyama... Kageyama Shigeo.

00:11:04.749 --> 00:11:09.004
Kageyama... I'm Hanazawa.
Hanazawa Teruki.

00:11:09.212 --> 00:11:11.756
Hi, Hanazawa-kun. Nice to meet you.

00:11:11.965 --> 00:11:14.384
No, not as a friend.

00:11:14.593 --> 00:11:16.428
I acknowledged you as an enemy.

00:11:16.636 --> 00:11:20.724
By doing that, I can get
even more serious about this.

00:11:26.062 --> 00:11:28.231
S-Stop this already.

00:11:28.440 --> 00:11:31.484
If you want to stop this, make me stop!

00:11:31.693 --> 00:11:33.737
Come on, come on, come on! What's wrong?

00:11:33.945 --> 00:11:35.614
Fight back, or you'll wind up badly hurt!

00:11:35.822 --> 00:11:37.449
You're dealing with me!

00:11:37.657 --> 00:11:41.286
I'm popular, and the
main character of the world!

00:11:41.494 --> 00:11:44.706
Everything revolves around me!

00:11:44.915 --> 00:11:48.960
Hanazawa Teruki is the chosen one!

00:11:49.169 --> 00:11:53.298
Why? How can you be
so confident in yourself?

00:11:53.506 --> 00:11:54.966
What a stupid question!

00:11:55.175 --> 00:11:57.594
It's because I have psychic powers!

00:11:57.802 --> 00:12:00.180
It's the power to control all!

00:12:00.388 --> 00:12:03.642
And you are my first enemy!

00:12:03.850 --> 00:12:07.145
Now, attack me!
Let's have a test of strength!

00:12:07.354 --> 00:12:08.563
No.

00:12:08.772 --> 00:12:12.150
Why?! I'm telling you that it's okay!

00:12:12.359 --> 00:12:15.070
Because... I don't want to
injure you really badly.

00:12:15.278 --> 00:12:16.905
Wha--?

00:12:18.114 --> 00:12:20.367
What a funny joke!

00:12:20.575 --> 00:12:23.370
Don't compare me to those average people.

00:12:23.578 --> 00:12:26.915
I'm on a completely different level
than them as living creatures.

00:12:27.123 --> 00:12:30.001
Being able to use
psychic powers isn't that...

00:12:30.210 --> 00:12:34.506
--What?
--Oh, well, I just thought you were going a bit overboard.

00:12:34.714 --> 00:12:37.926
You're the only person
who could make that argument.

00:12:38.134 --> 00:12:41.263
That's why you're an eyesore!

00:12:41.471 --> 00:12:46.810
Oh, I just realized why you
hold such animosity toward me.

00:12:47.018 --> 00:12:49.145
You don't like me because we're the same.

00:12:49.354 --> 00:12:51.731
You're sort of like me, Hanazawa-kun...

00:12:51.940 --> 00:12:54.150
Not the fact that we both
have psychic powers,

00:12:54.359 --> 00:12:56.778
but the fact that you have
no confidence in yourself, just like me.

00:12:56.987 --> 00:12:59.823
If you take away your psychic powers,
there'll be nothing left.

00:13:00.031 --> 00:13:01.741
You'll be empty.

00:13:01.950 --> 00:13:04.661
You're scared of that realization.

00:13:04.869 --> 00:13:07.622
No friends, and no standing out.

00:13:07.831 --> 00:13:11.459
Just another average loser
who won't leave a mark.

00:13:11.668 --> 00:13:13.586
That's me.

00:13:13.795 --> 00:13:16.423
Deep down, you're the same as me.

00:13:16.631 --> 00:13:19.676
You just don't want to admit that you're
nothing without your psychic powers--

00:13:19.884 --> 00:13:21.344
No!

00:13:21.553 --> 00:13:25.932
Quit dreaming! The two of us
are completely different!

00:13:26.141 --> 00:13:27.350
We're the same.

00:13:27.559 --> 00:13:30.145
From my perspective,
you're totally average.

00:13:30.353 --> 00:13:34.482
Shut up!

00:13:34.691 --> 00:13:37.736
He's not using his powers...

00:13:44.617 --> 00:13:48.621
What am I doing? How did this happen?

00:13:48.830 --> 00:13:52.834
Damn it, it's you! This is all your fault!

00:13:53.043 --> 00:13:54.461
Everything was perfect.

00:13:54.669 --> 00:13:56.463
Teru-kun, you got another perfect score?

00:13:56.671 --> 00:13:57.839
As long as I used my powers,

00:13:58.048 --> 00:13:59.507
--everything went
exactly how I wanted it to go.

00:13:59.507 --> 00:14:02.135
--What was that shot? That was amazing!
--everything went exactly how I wanted it to go.

00:14:02.344 --> 00:14:04.596
We're sorry! Please forgive us!

00:14:04.804 --> 00:14:06.890
And yet, you took my world...

00:14:07.098 --> 00:14:08.767
U-Um... I made some cookies,
if you'd like some.

00:14:08.975 --> 00:14:13.313
You... Your existence...

00:14:14.773 --> 00:14:16.816
...destroyed that!

00:14:17.025 --> 00:14:19.152
Damn it!

00:14:19.361 --> 00:14:24.240
Use them! Use your psychic powers!

00:14:25.867 --> 00:14:27.494
No...

00:14:28.411 --> 00:14:31.247
I can't use them...

00:14:31.915 --> 00:14:34.709
--...against people!
--Is he coming?!

00:14:39.631 --> 00:14:40.965
What the heck was that?

00:14:41.174 --> 00:14:44.094
Just how much are you going
to keep rejecting me?

00:14:44.302 --> 00:14:48.348
Hey, Kageyama. Didn't you say
that you started working out?

00:14:48.556 --> 00:14:53.478
That means that no matter how hard
you try, that's all you've got.

00:14:55.855 --> 00:14:58.858
People can't change that easily.

00:14:59.067 --> 00:15:02.987
Just give it up. Use your psychic powers.

00:15:03.196 --> 00:15:07.283
Otherwise, I'm going to...

00:15:08.243 --> 00:15:09.536
Give it back!

00:15:09.744 --> 00:15:12.705
Give us back our New Year's money!

00:15:12.914 --> 00:15:16.209
Don't get so cocky, brat. I'll kill you.

00:15:16.418 --> 00:15:19.796
--Ritsu!
--You stay out of this!

00:15:20.964 --> 00:15:23.299
Nii-san!

00:15:23.508 --> 00:15:26.511
Nii-sa...

00:15:26.719 --> 00:15:29.389
It hurts, Nii-san...

00:15:29.597 --> 00:15:31.307
I'm going to change.

00:15:33.977 --> 00:15:35.770
I won't use them.

00:15:37.439 --> 00:15:40.024
I'm going to change.

00:15:48.074 --> 00:15:50.285
Huh? Hey, Kageyama?

00:15:50.493 --> 00:15:52.745
Hey... Hey! Wake up!

00:15:52.954 --> 00:15:55.540
Wait! Don't leave me behind!

00:15:55.748 --> 00:15:58.001
Kageyama...

00:16:01.838 --> 00:16:04.799
Kageyama Shigeo and Hanazawa Teruki.

00:16:05.008 --> 00:16:09.762
The battle between these two espers
never reached its conclusion.

00:16:09.971 --> 00:16:12.765
As a result of rejecting each other's ideals,

00:16:12.974 --> 00:16:14.350
there was no victor,

00:16:14.559 --> 00:16:20.023
and they were only left with a feeling
of emptiness deep in their hearts.

00:16:20.231 --> 00:16:22.275
Or so it seemed...

00:16:28.948 --> 00:16:31.034
What... is that?

00:16:33.578 --> 00:16:35.997
Do you finally feel like fighting?

00:16:36.206 --> 00:16:40.627
Good! In the end, you couldn't
stay true to your ideals, either!

00:16:40.835 --> 00:16:43.171
Bring it! Ultimate Barrier!

00:16:52.430 --> 00:16:55.266
You used them! Kageyama!

00:16:55.475 --> 00:17:00.355
You finally couldn't stand it anymore
and used your psychic powers!

00:17:00.563 --> 00:17:04.609
You used them against another person!

00:17:04.817 --> 00:17:05.568
Huh?

00:17:05.777 --> 00:17:11.074
Is he unconscious?
Then what the hell is this power?

00:17:11.282 --> 00:17:13.284
What...?

00:17:13.493 --> 00:17:16.037
My powers are being
sucked in by Kageyama...

00:17:16.246 --> 00:17:20.083
No, that's not all... All of
the energy in the atmosphere...

00:17:20.291 --> 00:17:23.795
Are you telling me his vessel
is able to handle this much?

00:17:25.213 --> 00:17:30.260
Teru sensed in there something
that must never be touched.

00:17:30.468 --> 00:17:34.222
Something incomparable,
its identity unknown.

00:17:39.561 --> 00:17:44.232
You're kidding...
What in the world did I awaken?

00:17:51.990 --> 00:17:55.660
That's enough! I'm sorry!

00:17:55.868 --> 00:18:00.456
I won't use my psychic powers
against other people!

00:18:05.128 --> 00:18:08.381
Oh, I guess...

00:18:08.590 --> 00:18:12.093
...I'm actually just an average person...

00:18:19.017 --> 00:18:22.562
It didn't take long for Mob to realize.

00:18:22.770 --> 00:18:25.398
He failed to change.

00:18:25.607 --> 00:18:29.527
He caused another accident
because of his psychic powers.

00:18:31.613 --> 00:18:34.824
He didn't know
where to direct his emotions.

00:18:35.033 --> 00:18:38.745
He was overwhelmed, his powerlessness
born from contradictions.

00:18:38.953 --> 00:18:42.957
The feeling that he would never
be able to conquer himself...

00:18:43.166 --> 00:18:45.001
Sadness.

00:18:49.005 --> 00:18:54.719
This was Mob's meager attempt
at resistance towards himself.

00:19:08.232 --> 00:19:10.109
Hanazawa-kun, um...

00:19:10.318 --> 00:19:14.238
--I'm sorry about your clothes an--
--W-Wait! Kageyama, I'm...

00:19:14.447 --> 00:19:17.533
Ow... What happened with the fight?

00:19:17.742 --> 00:19:19.827
It's Teru-san! He's right over there.

00:19:20.036 --> 00:19:22.538
Huh? What the hell?

00:19:22.747 --> 00:19:25.083
He's been brutally executed!

00:19:25.291 --> 00:19:27.168
I-I'm not gonna let that happen to my hair!

00:19:27.377 --> 00:19:29.462
Those guys...

00:19:29.671 --> 00:19:33.508
You just saw it, Kageyama.
It's just as you said...

00:19:33.716 --> 00:19:35.885
--If you take away our psychic powers...

00:19:35.885 --> 00:19:37.178
--Kageyama-kun!
--If you take away our psychic powers...

00:19:37.387 --> 00:19:39.263
Ah, guys...

00:19:39.472 --> 00:19:41.974
Hey, Kageyama, are you hurt?

00:19:42.183 --> 00:19:44.352
I'm fine.

00:19:44.560 --> 00:19:45.853
All right, then, good.

00:19:46.062 --> 00:19:49.107
We're gonna go back and do more squats!

00:19:49.315 --> 00:19:51.943
There's nothing I can even say.

00:19:52.151 --> 00:19:54.237
I completely lost.

00:19:56.948 --> 00:20:00.827
"Under Construction"

00:20:12.547 --> 00:20:17.844
Mob searched for about three hours,
but he couldn't find Dimple.

00:20:19.387 --> 00:20:21.222
I'm home.

00:20:24.684 --> 00:20:26.352
Nii-san?

00:20:26.561 --> 00:20:29.689
Welcome home. You're gonna catch a cold.

00:20:29.897 --> 00:20:31.607
