high school kids picked a fight with us.

00:21:16.694 --> 00:21:19.322
You didn't do anything to me, Nii-san.

00:21:19.530 --> 00:21:22.992
One of the punks
kicked me away, and I got hurt.

00:21:23.201 --> 00:21:26.746
But you protected me, Nii-san.

00:21:26.954 --> 00:21:30.917
You should get over it already. Good night.

